{"id":"fce1590f59d86e3d","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-exact-at.md","title":"ZFC Algebra2 Module Exact At","display":"df-zfc-algebra2-module-exact-at — ZFC Algebra2 Module Exact At","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-exact-at","aliases":["58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-exact-at"],"display":"df-zfc-algebra2-module-exact-at — ZFC Algebra2 Module Exact At","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-exact-at"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-exact-at</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-algebra2-module-exact-at — ZFC Algebra2 Module Exact At"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g,A,B,C,R\\in V\">\\(f,g,A,B,C,R\\in V\\)</span> (two consecutive maps, three module carriers, and scalar-ring carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S\\)</span> (structured left-module predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-coded function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleExactAt}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleExactAt}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}module\\text{-}exact\\text{-}at}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleExactAt}_S(f,g,A,B,C,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_A,0_A,+_B,0_B,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\n\\odot_A,\\odot_B,\\odot_C\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{Module}_S(A,R,+_A,0_A,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(B,R,+_B,0_B,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(C,R,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\nf(x+_Ay)=f(x)+_Bf(y)\n\\land f(r\\odot_Ax)=r\\odot_Bf(x)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in B\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\ng(x+_By)=g(x)+_Cg(y)\n\\land g(r\\odot_Bx)=r\\odot_Cg(x)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\Bigl(\ng(b)=0_C\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;(f(a)=b)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}module\\text{-}exact\\text{-}at}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleExactAt}_S(f,g,A,B,C,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_A,0_A,+_B,0_B,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\n\\odot_A,\\odot_B,\\odot_C\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{Module}_S(A,R,+_A,0_A,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(B,R,+_B,0_B,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(C,R,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\nf(x+_Ay)=f(x)+_Bf(y)\n\\land f(r\\odot_Ax)=r\\odot_Bf(x)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in B\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\ng(x+_By)=g(x)+_Cg(y)\n\\land g(r\\odot_Bx)=r\\odot_Cg(x)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\Bigl(\ng(b)=0_C\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;(f(a)=b)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is exactness at the middle module <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>: the set-theoretic image of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> equals the kernel of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>All three module structures share the same displayed ring operations, so the two homomorphism clauses cannot silently choose incompatible structures on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S$ (structured left-module predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-coded function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,g,A,B,C,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleExactAt}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}module\\text{-}exact\\text{-}at}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleExactAt}_S(f,g,A,B,C,R)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_A,0_A,+_B,0_B,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\n\\odot_A,\\odot_B,\\odot_C\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\qquad\\mathrm{Module}_S(A,R,+_A,0_A,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(B,R,+_B,0_B,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(C,R,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,C)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\nf(x+_Ay)=f(x)+_Bf(y)\n\\land f(r\\odot_Ax)=r\\odot_Bf(x)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in B\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\ng(x+_By)=g(x)+_Cg(y)\n\\land g(r\\odot_Bx)=r\\odot_Cg(x)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\Bigl(\ng(b)=0_C\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;(f(a)=b)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1956,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-364","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-exact-at]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1425","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-exact-at.md|58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-exact-at]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ef3a5dd6825f0373","36d7463d215be751"]}